  "description": "□ Story\nPolux, a freelance hero,\nis struck by a mysterious curse—\nthe curse of the treasure box!\n\nTo break it, he sets off on a strange and winding journey,\ncrossing seas and mountains alike.\n\nMaster the power of “Invincibility”\nand charge headfirst into adventure!\n\n□ Game Overview\nSwing your sword, jump into action,\nand conquer the monsters and dungeons that stand in your way!\n\nIn times of danger, press the Defense Button!\nHop into a box and you’re mostly invincible!*\n\n*Some exceptions apply. Thank you for your understanding.\n\n□ Features\n15 stages + ? included!\nPowerful bosses may be waiting at the end of each stage!\n\nCollect points (money) and trade them at the shop\nfor useful items to aid your adventure!\n\nTake on Challenge Stages with\nthree types of Time Attack modes—and more…?\n\nFind hidden Crystals in stages to increase your max HP!\nExploration-support items also make an appearance!\n\nIncludes a Monster Encyclopedia!\nView descriptions and comments for every monster you encounter!\n\nThe \"Pixel Game Maker Series\" is a series of games created using the action game creation software \"Pixel Game Maker MV\" that can be enjoyed on the Nintendo Switch™.",
